<%- include('../partials/header', { title, currentPath, currentUser, csrf, flash, appName }) %>
<section class="ewrap-hero">
  <div class="ewrap-hero-copy"><span class="ewrap-eyebrow">A cleaner Calabar starts here</span><h1>Give old electronics a better next chapter.</h1><p>Find a collection point, learn how to handle e-waste safely, and see how small actions add up across our campus community.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4"><a class="ewrap-btn" href="/centers">Explore collection points <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="ewrap-btn ewrap-outline" href="/articles/awareness">Learn the basics</a></div></div>
  <aside class="ewrap-impact"><span class="ewrap-eyebrow">THE COMMUNITY AT A GLANCE</span><div class="ewrap-impact-number"><%= Number(stats.logs).toLocaleString() %></div><p>recycling actions recorded</p><div class="ewrap-impact-bottom"><div><strong><%= stats.centers %></strong><span>collection points</span></div><div><strong><%= stats.articles %></strong><span>guides & policies</span></div></div></aside>
</section>
<section class="ewrap-home-grid row g-3">
  <div class="col-md-4"><article class="ewrap-card h-100"><span class="ewrap-step">01 / LEARN</span><h2>Know what happens next</h2><p>Get clear advice on safe storage, personal data and responsible recycling.</p><a href="/articles/awareness">Visit the awareness hub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div>
  <div class="col-md-4"><article class="ewrap-card h-100"><span class="ewrap-step">02 / FIND</span><h2>Choose a place to return it</h2><p>Search listed Calabar locations and find the nearest point on the map.</p><a href="/centers">Open the centre directory <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div>
  <div class="col-md-4"><article class="ewrap-card h-100"><span class="ewrap-step">03 / TAKE PART</span><h2>Make your action count</h2><p>Report campus e-waste and keep a record of the devices you recycle.</p><a href="<%= currentUser ? '/dashboard' : '/register' %>">Track your participation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article></div>
</section>
<section class="ewrap-latest"><div class="ewrap-sectionhead"><div><span class="ewrap-eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW</span><h2>Start with a safer habit</h2></div><a href="/articles/awareness">All guides →</a></div><div class="row g-3"><% articles.forEach((article) => { %><div class="col-md-4"><article class="ewrap-card h-100"><span class="ewrap-chip"><%= article.category %></span><h3><%= article.title %></h3><p><%= article.body.slice(0, 135) %><%= article.body.length > 135 ? '…' : '' %></p></article></div><% }) %></div></section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
